<title>JAPAN: Japan 10-year JGB auction lowest price of 100.80.</title>
<headline>Japan 10-year JGB auction lowest price of 100.80.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the 2.4 percent 195th  10-year Japanese government bond (JGB) auction, covering 60</p>
<p>percent of the one trillion yen issue, were as follows, the</p>
<p>Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> Lowest price	 100.80   Stop rate     2.301 pct</p>
<p> Average price	100.85   Average yield 2.295 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   4.0085 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted bids	591.19 billion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 3.6252 pct</p>
<p> Issue date   May 20, 1997   Maturity   June 20, 2007</p>
</text>
